#ASSERT `s 187(4) the shadow director's general notice is made ineffective by subsection (4)` TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 187(4) the shadow director's general notice is made ineffective by subsection (4)` TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
